{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_1000_situation", "source_sha256": "e496449435d90fc19974908914d07c2a2a394ab5144bc19e3840fd47c8353899", "ja": "サイン会のお仕事", "zh": "签名会工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_1000_place", "source_sha256": "dc2eab181b21579d24af8758a5c8880d3a25c4048161584a8837b0a8c92754ca", "ja": "控え室", "zh": "准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6f2fd3172a275d5f1b294f405d69561b971384142b7d65adf01ef1dfd302d81d", "ja": "（のり子が珍しく静かだと思ったら、サインの\n練習をしてるのか。……でも、もう限界みたいだな）", "zh": "（难得看法子这么安静，原来在练习签名啊……\n但看来快到极限了呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "1f089f7a37f9103e9247d4959c13a70c295966117629a85e0a3cbb1a9c5b4684", "ja": "……だーっ！！　もうっ、難しすぎるよ～！\n2つのことを同時にやるなんてっ！", "zh": "……啊──！！实在太难了啦～！\n竟然要同时做两件事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "03f30e6a506da0da23995e750b7d6c7f25258cfd945cf332e5953975e749d049", "ja": "どうやったら、お客さんと会話しながら、サインも\n書けるの！？　ねぇ、{$P$}！", "zh": "要怎样才能一边和客人对话，一边签名呢！？\n请告诉我啊，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_1004_p", "source_sha256": "12c5b0abbc698f0fd67661522df4ffc06db09f43c1e29e984c40a8514508a06b", "ja": "まぁまぁ、のり子……。そうだな、プロレスで\nイメージすれば、コツが掴めるんじゃないか？", "zh": "好了好了，法子……对了，只要想像一下\n职业摔角，就能抓到诀窍了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cc78c03e9d1df818429e475a238d09a471f6e084e56949ae14356fbb668e097c", "ja": "ほら、敵のタックルに備えつつ、隙をついて\n技を決めに行く！　みたいな感じで……。", "zh": "你想想，就是一边准备应付敌方的擒抱，一边\n看准漏洞，用绝招一决胜负！这样的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "8d9ad2ded7715232e417488cbab9ebd7a46a1c0bce92ca2723d41088a59667e3", "ja": "んん？　ん～？　……なるほど、そういう感じか！\nうん、なんか乗り切れる気がしてきたかも！", "zh": "嗯嗯？嗯～？……原来如此，是这种感觉啊！\n嗯，感觉好像能突破现况了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3b982dbdb24dbfea38d41c73e9baf1904f0141e651b4ab2fd723d99b173a7f25", "ja": "（あまり自信のある例えじゃなかったけど……\nのり子は、何か掴めたみたいだ。よかった！）", "zh": "（虽然我对这个举例没什么自信……\n但法子似乎有所领悟，太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
